menu "OBD client"

config OBD_LOOPBACK_ECU_SIMULATOR
    bool "Internal OBD-II ECU simulator (MCP2515 loopback)"
    default n
    help
        Run the OBD request scheduler and an internal fake ECU using the MCP2515
        hardware loopback mode. The 0x7DF request and 0x7E8 response are looped
        back internally and do not drive the physical CAN bus. This tests the
        CAN controller TX/RX path, OBD PID parser, and display without a vehicle
        or a second CAN transceiver. It does not validate physical CAN wiring,
        transceiver operation, or vehicle compatibility.

endmenu
